2.1 Create DLP Device Control Policy
Policy name: YourName-DeviceControl-Policy

Rules:

Block USB storage devices

Allow only encrypted devices for Finance & HR

Monitor Bluetooth file transfers

Disable copying to CD/DVD drives


2.2 Create Content-Aware Protection
Create a rule named: YourName-ConfidentialDataRule

Detect and block:

PAN numbers or SSN or other PII related to your region

Salary files or financial data or email address

Source-code files

PDF exports containing financial statements

Actions:

Block transfer

Notify user

Log incident


2.3 Configure DLP Exfiltration Reports
Create a report showing: 

Attempts to copy sensitive files

Attempts to upload data to cloud drives

Email content sharing violations

Report name: YourName-DLP-IncidentReport


