3. Browser Security
3.1 Create Browser Security Policy
Policy name: YourName-BrowserSecurityPolicy

Configuration:

Block malicious URLs

Force Safe Browsing Mode in Chrome & Edge

Prevent file downloads from unknown domains

Disable use of risky extensions

Allow approved extensions only (e.g., Grammarly, Zoom)
